    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2208.01639v1</id>
    <title>Sharpening Your Tools: Updating bulk_extractor for the 2020s</title>
    <updated>2022-03-31T17:45:46Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.01639v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2208.01639v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>Bulk_extractor is a high-performance digital forensics tool written in C++. Between 2018 and 2022 we updated the program from C++98 to C++17, performed a complete code refactoring, and adopted a unit test framework. The new version typically runs with 75\% more throughput than the previous version, which we attribute to improved multithreading. We provide lessons and recommendations for other digital forensics tool maintainers.</summary>
